00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:18.880
Ojiichan!

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:22.820
Watches, you see...
eventually stop unless you rewind them.

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:23.950
Rewind?!

00:17:23.950 --> 00:17:24.820
So, how's it going...
Rewind?!

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:24.890
Rewind?!

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:27.590
How are you doing with that Madoka girl?

00:17:27.590 --> 00:17:30.730
O...Ojiichan! That's none of your business!

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:32.820
Whatever! Whatever you say!

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:40.230
A...Ayukawa! Thanks for before.

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:43.940
Don't take it the wrong way.
I did it for Hikaru's sake, y'know.

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:50.610
Say... are you sure that the umpire doesn't have to be back there?

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:54.840
It's fine! Fine! Those that will
become happy, let them be, I say.

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:58.620
Say, Kurumi, I'll settle for this -
let me "kiss" you!

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:03.390
This isn't right!

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:06.360
Mmmmmm...!
This isn't right!

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:09.700
How was it? The taste of a ripe woman, that is!

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:13.660
S...Sensational, ma'am...

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:19.910
Fault! 40-Love.

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:24.010
I don't care how much I get misunderstood...

00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:27.080
I just don't wanna let anybody else kiss her!

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:41.090
40-15!

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:44.560
Hikaru... Is it my imagination,
or have you been gunning for me?

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:49.240
Of course I am! I can only rack up
points from you, after all!

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:51.610
Do you want to win that much?!

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:54.400
You bet! 'Cause, if I win...

00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:59.650
"Hikaru - Kyosuke"
"Madoka - Yuusaku"

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:12.090
Set 2 - Over. Score: 4-3.
Madoka-Yuusaku Team to serve.

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:23.170
Out!

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:26.080
30-40!

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:32.140
And so, we hung tough, and now
we're only a point away from victory...

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:37.350
Advantage: Kyosuke-Hikaru Team!

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:41.620
If I win this point,
Ayukawa won't be kissing!

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:45.650
But, wait a second... If we win, then I'll be kissing Hikaru...

00:19:53.570 --> 00:19:56.770
I... I won't make it!

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:02.180
It...It won't stop!

00:20:03.350 --> 00:20:04.900
Line Out!

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:07.720
My body...

00:20:11.150 --> 00:20:12.390
Kasuga!

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:14.460
Darling!

00:20:25.230 --> 00:20:28.940
"A...Ayukawa! Ayukawa, where are we?!"

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:32.340
"Kasuga... You've stopped time
once too often!

00:20:33.070 --> 00:20:36.810
"We can never be at the same place
together ever again!

00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:38.310
"Looks like we're through."

00:20:38.650 --> 00:20:40.350
"A...Ayukawa!

00:20:40.350 --> 00:20:43.750
"Why... Why can't I stop time?! I was only doing it for you!"

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:54.030
"Wait!"

00:20:54.030 --> 00:20:58.280
"Darling... We can't always
be together like we are now!"

00:20:58.280 --> 00:21:00.240
"You're kidding!
Why are you saying that?

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:02.330
"Why can't we be like the way we are?!

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:04.100
"Why can't I stop time?!"

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:07.510
"Ayukawa! Hikaru!

00:21:08.610 --> 00:21:10.980
"Oh, Time, be still!

00:21:10.980 --> 00:21:13.010
"Be still!"

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:21.190
Yes, that's right! He's motionless... He won't move at all!

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:24.860
Hello?! Yes, sir...
Right, there's no pulse either!

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:26.190
In that case, please give up.

00:21:26.190 --> 00:21:26.680
What?!
In that case, please give up.

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:28.160
What?!
What?!

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:31.730
Kasuga!

00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:34.460
Are you worried about Kyosuke that much?

00:21:37.910 --> 00:21:40.400
He's... my friend, after all.

00:21:40.680 --> 00:21:44.840
Perhaps an evil witch
cast a spell upon Kyosuke.

00:21:45.250 --> 00:21:45.650
What?!

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:48.440
That's right. Like in "Snow White."
What?!

00:21:48.440 --> 00:21:49.550
"Snow White?!"
That's right. Like in "Snow White."

00:21:49.550 --> 00:21:49.680
"Snow White?!"

00:21:49.680 --> 00:21:50.620
That's right.
"Snow White?!"

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:50.660
"Snow White?!"

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:54.520
Kyosuke is Snow White, asleep due to a spell.

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:59.190
If we could only find a Prince to kiss
Snow White, everything will be okay.

00:21:59.190 --> 00:22:03.990
A-ha! All right, Obaasama! Count on me!

00:22:04.730 --> 00:22:09.690
"Oh! Ayukawa! Don't go!

00:22:12.410 --> 00:22:14.380
"Ayukawa!"

00:22:18.580 --> 00:22:21.780
Kasuga...

00:22:22.380 --> 00:22:26.220
Maybe... I was the evil witch all along...

00:22:28.690 --> 00:22:30.660
I'm sorry...

00:22:35.900 --> 00:22:39.160
...for never being honest...

00:22:41.240 --> 00:22:44.400
Sempai! My Snow White!

00:22:45.440 --> 00:22:47.410
Awaken from your slumber!

00:22:52.210 --> 00:22:54.750
H... Huh?

00:22:54.750 --> 00:22:56.120
Wh... What happened...?!

00:22:56.120 --> 00:22:58.050
Yeah! All right!
Wh... What happened...?!

00:22:58.050 --> 00:22:58.120
Wh... What happened...?!

00:22:58.120 --> 00:23:03.180
The Kiss of Victory! Daringly-Sensationally- Electrifyingly-Emotional!

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:10.230
Of course it froze you!

00:23:10.230 --> 00:23:12.600
Because you wound it backwards!

00:23:12.600 --> 00:23:15.070
It's completely the opposite of normal watches!

00:23:15.070 --> 00:23:18.440
That's right. So when you turn it on,
this is what happens...

00:23:20.240 --> 00:23:24.280
So how did it feel?
To be awakened by a girl's kiss?

00:23:24.280 --> 00:23:26.070
What?! Well...!

00:23:26.070 --> 00:23:28.440
Sempai!

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:31.890
Off you go, Young-At-Heart Old Man!

00:23:50.070 --> 00:23:58.580
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:23:58.580 --> 00:24:02.450
At a train station on a faraway day...

00:24:02.450 --> 00:24:14.160
...snowflakes dance on the platform,
and you came running, out of breath.

00:24:14.160 --> 00:24:19.940
The days we had to be apart made the memory of you...

00:24:19.940 --> 00:24:28.280
...a happy one, like seeing your photograph.

00:24:28.280 --> 00:24:35.810
"I just dance in the sweet memories" Each time we're hurt we learn...

00:24:35.810 --> 00:24:43.460
"I just dance in the sweet memories" ...what it takes to love someone.

00:24:43.460 --> 00:24:51.100
"I just dance in the sweet memories"
(He's my one and only; you never can tell)

00:24:51.100 --> 00:24:58.640
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:24:58.640 --> 00:25:04.670
"I just dance in the sweet memories"

00:25:12.220 --> 00:25:14.660
I just find it hard to understand how...

00:25:14.660 --> 00:25:17.030
...a girl can fall for another girl.

00:25:17.030 --> 00:25:19.660
Hoshi Sumire, a girl who's fallen for Ayukawa...

00:25:19.660 --> 00:25:23.400
...enters her house uninvited,
and makes me look like the bad guy!

00:25:23.400 --> 00:25:25.740
She thinks she's some
movie heroine or something!

00:25:25.740 --> 00:25:30.200
Next time: "Such a Popular Madoka!
Kyosuke Finally Reveals His Feelings."
